    "created_at": "2019-10-16T16:57:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-10-16T16:57:54Z",
    "body": "For forms, couldn't user agents just take the \"label\" from the form's default button and display that if pressing enter would result in a submit? Not sure if `enterkeyhint` is very relevant in that scenario.",
