    "created_at": "2019-10-16T17:01:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-10-16T17:01:41Z",
    "body": "That's an interesting idea. My concern is that the form button's label may not fit on all keyboards, especially small screens. Maybe the enterkeyhint attribute of the default button would be sufficient to set the default for the entire form?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
