    "created_at": "2019-10-16T17:03:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-10-16T17:03:27Z",
    "body": "You don't need to specify it on each element. In fact default on Android for Chrome if nothing is specified it presents the next element (which automatically changes focus to the next element) and submit on the last one (which submits the form).",
